# Board runner

- Red-zone paths live in `docs/architecture/zones.md` and `scripts/ci/board_policy.py`. Keep them in agreement. [why: convention]
- Content-kind briefs may only change `content/**` and stay exempt from the red-zone refusal. [why: convention]
- Do not loosen a protected path here unless the lx-software admin Lambda copy is updated first. Siutindei may be stricter. [why: convention]
- The runner does not commit with the checkout token. Credentials are attached only in the commit step. [why: convention]
